{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"深く深く夢の中に、、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"縷縷夢兎個展『PLAY HOUSE』\nかにょんとりりこと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花音とリリコと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（可愛い空間に縷縷夢兎を着た可愛い女の子沢山いてしあわせだった、、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒宮れいちゃん、来夢ちゃん\n弓ライカちゃん、mizukiちゃん\nが出演してる新作映像3本、\n全部素敵でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいちゃんと来夢ちゃんは前作よりもちょっと大人に近づいてて美しさ増してました。\nライカちゃんとmizukiちゃんの二人の表現力もすきだな～ライカちゃんの目の強さすきだな～これは何回も見て佳苗さんのこの作品で伝えたいメッセージを読み取りたい...."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"縷縷夢兎を何度か袖に通させてもらっているありがたみ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な個展、\n今日からはじまってますのでぜひ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は、\n禁断の多数決っていう\nバンドが気になりすぎてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほげちゃん..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ最近で一番グッときた女の子....\nみんなかわいすぎだ～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何してるとき幸せ？？？？\n普段何考えてる？？？\nってメンバーのだれかに最近きかれたけど、\n即答「可愛い子の事を常に考えてるし、可愛い子のことを考えるのが幸せだし、ストレス発散も可愛い子をみること、そして趣味は可愛い子発掘。特に一番の幸せはあのちゃんの写真がアップされたとき。」以上。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを聞いて一言\n「凄いね。」終了。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいい病。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日発売されました\nまるっと乃木坂のプレイボーイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなちさんとちはるの\n割とまじで答えにくい\n真剣な相談に答えました(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"偉そうだけど自分置いといて、Pとして！\nキャラとかについて...こんなこと思ってても人に対しては口出さないタイプなので本誌で読んでね～～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0014.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}